{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947280/extras/a4c42de2f69cc1b39879b99dc67fb554.avif?t=1768932291\" width=348 height=116 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving a brutal storm at sea, Simon Rhodes awakens on a mysterious island ruled by a sprawling hedge maze and its terrifying inhabitants.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through relentless enemies, conserve your limited bullets, and survive as long as you can in this retro-inspired top-down arcade challenge.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <i>Normal Play</i> for a gradual challenge or <i>Difficult Play</i> for instant chaos. Achieve your highest score across both modes!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade, shoot, or outmaneuver monsters in a top-down hedge maze.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From invisible ghosts to relentless werewolves, each foe behaves uniquely.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three grenades \u2013 A last-resort panic button to clear the screen when overwhelmed.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four maze layouts to choose from.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two difficulty modes:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Normal Play</i> \u2013 Easier start, progressive difficulty ramp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Difficult Play</i> \u2013 Instant chaos. All enemies are  aggressive from the start.\u00a0</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate high score tables for each mode.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 2nd generation \u201cStalker/Cavern\u201d games of the early 1980s.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no maps, no allies, and no way to fight forever. How long can you last before the hedge consumes you?\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947280?t=1768932291","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947280/1ec8d4289a2e6297e76f0a52ce870a68f0b54c25/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768932291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947280/df282978647f063fa7ff84d54114ecc830242fc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768932291","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947280/df282978647f063fa7ff84d54114ecc830242fc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768932291","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947280/extras/a4c42de2f69cc1b39879b99dc67fb554.avif?t=1768932291\" width=348 height=116 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving a brutal storm at sea, Simon Rhodes awakens on a mysterious island ruled by a sprawling hedge maze and its terrifying inhabitants.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through relentless enemies, conserve your limited bullets, and survive as long as you can in this retro-inspired top-down arcade challenge.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <i>Normal Play</i> for a gradual challenge or <i>Difficult Play</i> for instant chaos. Achieve your highest score across both modes!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade, shoot, or outmaneuver monsters in a top-down hedge maze.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From invisible ghosts to relentless werewolves, each foe behaves uniquely.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three grenades \u2013 A last-resort panic button to clear the screen when overwhelmed.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four maze layouts to choose from.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two difficulty modes:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Normal Play</i> \u2013 Easier start, progressive difficulty ramp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Difficult Play</i> \u2013 Instant chaos. All enemies are  aggressive from the start.\u00a0</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate high score tables for each mode.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 2nd generation \u201cStalker/Cavern\u201d games of the early 1980s.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no maps, no allies, and no way to fight forever. How long can you last before the hedge consumes you?\u00a0</p>","developers":["Xayba"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947280/21a7f58377445c7e136547044305a7a39287945f/header.jpg?t=1768932291","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Xayba Games, LLC. Nocturne Maze is a trademark of Xayba Games, LLC. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_re